<view class="detail-page page-with-bg">
  <image class="page-bg" src="/assets/study-bg.png" mode="widthFix" aria-hidden="true" />

  <view class="detail-content">
    <view class="detail-hero">
      <view class="detail-kicker">3 分钟读懂人工耳蜗</view>
      <view class="detail-hero__title">人工耳蜗，究竟在做什么？</view>
      <view class="detail-hero__desc">先不用记复杂术语。理解声音如何进入大脑，就能明白它为什么可以帮助人听见。</view>
      <image
        class="detail-hero__visual"
        src="/assets/icons/learn-detail-hero.svg"
        mode="aspectFit"
        aria-hidden="true"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="lead-block">
      <view class="lead-block__label">先记住这一点</view>
      <view class="lead-block__title">它不是把声音放大，而是把声音“翻译”成电信号。</view>
      <view class="lead-block__text">助听器主要让声音更响；人工耳蜗会提取声音里的关键线索，转换成听神经可以接收的刺激，再由大脑学习理解。</view>
    </view>

    <view class="reading-section">
      <view class="reading-title">它怎样把声音送到大脑？</view>
      <view class="reading-intro">整个过程可以理解为连续的三步。</view>

      <view class="process-list">
        <view class="process-item">
          <view class="process-marker"><text>1</text></view>
          <view class="process-copy">
            <view class="process-title">收集声音</view>
            <view class="process-text">外部处理器上的麦克风，先接收周围的说话声和环境声。</view>
          </view>
        </view>
        <view class="process-item">
          <view class="process-marker"><text>2</text></view>
          <view class="process-copy">
            <view class="process-title">找出关键线索</view>
            <view class="process-text">处理器分析声音，保留语音的强弱、节奏和主要频率信息。</view>
          </view>
        </view>
        <view class="process-item">
          <view class="process-marker"><text>3</text></view>
          <view class="process-copy">
            <view class="process-title">刺激听神经</view>
            <view class="process-text">植入体把信息变成电脉冲，通过耳蜗内的电极传给听神经。</view>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="reading-section">
      <view class="reading-title">声音最后去了哪里？</view>
      <view class="reading-intro">设备负责传递信息，真正理解声音的仍然是大脑。</view>

      <view class="sound-route">
        <view class="sound-route__line"></view>
        <view class="sound-route__step sound-route__step--active"><view class="sound-route__dot"></view><text>声音</text></view>
        <view class="sound-route__step"><view class="sound-route__dot"></view><text>处理器</text></view>
        <view class="sound-route__step"><view class="sound-route__dot"></view><text>电极</text></view>
        <view class="sound-route__step"><view class="sound-route__dot"></view><text>听神经</text></view>
        <view class="sound-route__step"><view class="sound-route__dot"></view><text>大脑</text></view>
      </view>

      <view class="reading-note">刚开始使用人工耳蜗时，一些声音可能很陌生。随着聆听训练和日常使用，大脑会逐渐学会辨认这些新信号。</view>
    </view>

    <view class="reading-section">
      <view class="reading-title">为什么听起来不完全一样？</view>
      <view class="reading-intro">两者都能传递声音，但保留信息的精细程度不同。</view>

      <view class="compare-list">
        <view class="compare-item">
          <view class="compare-name">自然耳蜗</view>
          <view class="compare-text">依靠大量毛细胞分析声音，能够保留更丰富的音色、音高和细节。</view>
        </view>
        <view class="compare-item">
          <view class="compare-name">人工耳蜗</view>
          <view class="compare-text">通过有限数量的电极传递关键线索，更侧重帮助使用者理解语音。</view>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="frequency-block">
        <view class="frequency-copy">
          <view class="frequency-title">耳蜗里有一张“频率地图”</view>
          <view class="frequency-text">不同位置负责不同频率。人工耳蜗会参考这张地图，把声音信息交给对应的电极。</view>
        </view>
        <image
          class="frequency-image"
          src="/assets/icons/learn-detail-cochlea-map.svg"
          mode="aspectFit"
          aria-hidden="true"
        />
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="page-footnote">
      <view class="page-footnote__mark">i</view>
      <view>本页用于帮助理解基本原理，不代表每位使用者的真实听觉感受，也不能替代专业医疗建议。</view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
